  "Deal <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> DEF Ice damage to the main target and <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> DEF Ice damage to all other targets, with a <color=#FFFC40>$3</color> base chance to inflict <link=\"s|103\"><u>Freeze</u></link> to the main target; Restore $4 [Valour]. If you are in <link=\"s|202\"><u>[Justice Oath]</u></link>, additionally increase the main target's DMG Taken by ($6 for every $5 DEF you have), up to <color=#FFFC40>$7</color> for $8 turns; However, decrease [Valour] recovery to $9.": "",
