  "Give 1 ally 1 stack of <color=#FFFC40>$1</color> DEF + <color=#FFFC40>$2</color> Shield as <link=\"s|201\"><u>[Upright Mark]</u></link>, then increase their DEF equal to $3 own DEF (Up to <color=#FFFC40>$4</color>) for 2 turns; When gaining this effect, increase that ally's chance of attacked by $6 if their HP is above $5; At the start of your next turn, give that ally 1 stack of <link=\"s|201\"><u>[Upright Mark]</u></link>. If you are in <link=\"s|202\"><u>[Justice Oath]</u></link>, increase the Shield from <link=\"s|201\"><u>[Upright Mark]</u></link> by $6.": "",
