  "J<color=#000000>u</color>stice Judgement": "",
  "r:\"Deal Ice damage to the main target equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Ashiya's Defense, and deal Ice damage to other foes equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Ashiya's Defense\\.\\n<color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> chance to inflict <link\\=(.+?)><u>Freeze</u></link> on the main target, and gain (\\d+) Heroism stacks\\.\\nIf <link\\=(.+?)><u>Garden of Promises</u></link> is active, increase the main target's damage taken by (\\d+)% for every (\\d+) points of Ashiya's Defense \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\), but gain only (\\d+) Heroism stack\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"Grant 1 <link\\=(.+?)><u>Knight's Protection</u></link> shield equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Ashiya's Defense \\+ <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color> to 1 ally\\. Also increase the ally's Defense by (\\d+)% of Ashiya's Defense \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\) for (\\d+) turns\\. If the target granted this effect has more than (\\d+)% HP, increase rate to take attacks from foes by (\\d+)%\\.\\nAt the start of Ashiya's next turn, grant 1 Knight's Protection again to the same target\\. If <link\\=(.+?)><u>Garden of Promises</u></link> is active, increase shield granted from Knight's Protection by (\\d+)% for (\\d+) turns\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>(.+?)</color></size></b>\"": "",
  "r:\"^Grant all allies (\\d+) <link\\=\"s\\|201\"><u>Knight's Protection</u></link> shield equal to ([\\d\\.]+)% of Ashiya's Defense \\+ (\\d+)\\/(\\d+)\\/(\\d+) \\(effect changes at Lv\\. (\\d+)\\/(\\d+)\\/(\\d+), respectively\\) and <link\\=\"s\\|203\"><u>Knight's Resolve</u></link> shield equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color> of Ashiya's Defense \\+ <color\\=#FFFC40>(\\d+)</color>\\.\\nAlso increase all allies' Down Points by (\\d+) and damage dealt by ([\\d\\.]+)% for every (\\d+) points of Ashiya's Defense \\(up to <color\\=#FFFC40>([\\d\\.]+)%</color>\\) for (\\d+) turns\\.\\n<b><size\\=28><color\\=#850101>The determination to defend one's allies becomes a mighty fortress wall, granting shields to all allies\\.</color></size></b>$\"": "",
  "r:\"Highlight：Grant <link\\=(.+?)><u>Knight's Resolve</u></link> shield equal to <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> of Ashiya's Defense \\+ <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)</color> to all allies and decrease damage taken by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\.\\n1 MORE：Deal Ice damage to 1 foe\\.\\nMelee Attack：Deal Physical damage to 1 foe\\.\\nRanged Attack：Deal Gun damage to 1 foe\\. Can fire until out of ammo\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"When allies have a shield granted by Ashiya, increase Defense by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> and ailment resistance by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color>\\.\"": "",
  "r:\"While Ashiya is in battle, when an ally uses their ailment resistance to avoid a Curse, elemental ailment, or spiritual ailment, grant (\\d+), (\\d+), or (\\d+) buff stacks, respectively\\.\\nFor each buff stack, increase the targeted ally's damage dealt by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\. This can stack up to (\\d+) times\\. At (\\d+) buff stacks, also increase critical damage by <color\\=#FFFC40>(.+?)%</color> for (\\d+) turns\\.\"": "",
  "At the start of battle, grant all allies 1 <link\\=\"s|201\"><u>Knight's Protection</u></link> shield equal to 12% of Ashiya's Defense + 120/240/360 (effect changes at Lv. 1/50/70, respectively).\\nWhen an ally with Knight's Protection takes an attack, grant Ashiya 1 Heroism stack (up to 2 stacks in 1 turn). Heroism can stack up to 4 times.\\nAt the start of the turn, if Heroism is at 4 stacks, spend 4 Heroism stacks to gain <link\\=\"s|202\"><u>Garden of Promises</u></link> and grant Knight's Protection again to all allies.": "",
  "At the start of battle, gain 3 Heroism stacks. <link\\=\"s|202\"><u>Garden of Promises</u></link> requires 3 Heroism stacks to activate.\\nIncrease party's pierce rate by 20%.": "",
  "Increase Defense by 15%, damage dealt by 15%, and critical damage by 10% for every <link\\=\"s|201\"><u>Knight's Protection</u></link> shield. This effect can stack up to 2 times.\\nWhen the effect of Knight's Protection ends, restore the targeted ally's HP by 20% of remaining shield.": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Frost Vines and Winter Fortress by 3.": "",
  "Highlight Enhanced: Increase shield granted to party by 30% (lasts for 2 turns).": "",
  "Increase the skill levels of Hoarfrost Vow and Thief Tactics by 3.": "",
  "When gaining <link\\=\"s|202\"><u>Garden of Promises</u></link>, gain Poise for 3 turns.\\nPoise: Increase the party's critical rate by 15%.": "",
  "r:\"^Ice\\s+dmg\\s+to\\s+main\\s+target\\s+\\(([\\d.]+)%\\s+Def\\),\\s+and\\s+Ice\\s+dmg\\s+to\\s+other\\s+foes\\s+\\(([\\d.]+)%\\s+Def\\)\\.\\s+([\\d.]+)%\\s+chance\\s+to\\s+inflict\\s+Freeze\\s+on\\s+main\\s+target,\\s+and\\s+gain\\s+(\\d+)\\s+Heroism\\.\\s+If\\s+Garden\\s+of\\s+Promises\\s+is\\s+active,\\s+increase\\s+main\\s+target's\\s+dmg\\s+taken\\s+(\\d+)%\\s+per\\s+(\\d+)\\s+of\\s+(.+)'s\\s+Def\\s+\\(max\\s+([\\d.]+)%,\\s+(\\d+)\\s+turns\\),\\s+but\\s+change\\s+to\\s+(\\d+)\\s+Heroism\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Grant\\s+Knight's\\s+Protection\\s+shield\\s+to\\s+(\\d+)\\s+ally\\s+\\(([\\d.]+)%\\s+Def\\+\\s+(\\d+)\\)\\.\\s+Increase\\s+target's\\s+Def\\s+by\\s+(\\d+)%\\s+of\\s+(.+)'s\\s+Def\\s+\\(max\\s+(\\d+),\\s+(\\d+)\\s+turns\\)\\.\\s+When\\s+this\\s+ally's\\s+HP\\s+is\\s+above\\s+(\\d+)%,\\s+increase\\s+chance\\s+of\\s+being\\s+targeted\\s+(\\d+)%\\.\\s+At\\s+start\\s+of\\s+(.+)'s\\s+next\\s+action,\\s+grant\\s+(\\d+)\\s+more\\s+Knight's\\s+Protection\\s+to\\s+target\\.\\s+If\\s+Garden\\s+of\\s+Promises\\s+is\\s+active,\\s+increase\\s+granted\\s+Knight's\\s+Protection\\s+shield\\s+(\\d+)%\\s+\\((\\d+)\\s+turns\\)\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Grant\\s+all\\s+allies\\s+(\\d+)\\s+Knight's\\s+Protection\\s+shield\\s+\\((.+)Def\\s+\\+\\s+([\\d/]+)\\s+when\\s+at\\s+(.+)\\.\\s+([\\d/+]+\\)?),\\s+and\\s+Knight's\\s+Resolve\\s+shield\\s+\\((.+)Def\\s+\\+\\s+(\\d+)\\)\\.\\s+Also\\s+increase\\s+all\\s+allies'\\s+Down\\s+Points\\s+by\\s+(\\d+)\\s+and\\s+dmg\\s+dealt\\s+by\\s+(.+)%\\s+per\\s+(\\d+)\\s+of\\s+(.+)'s\\s+Def\\s+\\(max\\s+(.+)%,\\s+(\\d+)\\s+turns\\)\\.$\"": "",
  "r:\"^Grant\\s+Knight's\\s+Resolve\\s+shield\\s+to\\s+all\\s+allies\\s+\\(([\\d.]+)%\\s+Def\\s+\\+\\s+(\\d+)\\),\\s+and\\s+decrease\\s+dmg\\s+taken\\s+([\\d.]+)%\\s+\\((\\d+)\\s+turns\\)\\.$\"": ""
